Subject: IR6 Work Boundary Expected Ledger
Date: 2026-05-26

@ [fixture_plan] docs/fixtures/IR6_Coordination_Mailbox_Fixture_Plan.v1.sop
@ [claim_identity_contract] docs/coordination/IR6_Claim_Identity_And_Work_Boundary_Projection_Contract.v1.sop
@ [activation_boundary] docs/implementation/IR6_Bounded_Coordination_Implementation_Activation_Boundary.v1.sop

& [ExpectedWorkBoundaryLedger: IR6CoordinationMailbox] is the expected work-boundary ledger
  + [dependency_closed_status_allowed] is true_when_fresh_supported_and_uncontested
  + [dependency_closed_status_forbidden] is true_when_conflicting
  + [dependency_closed_status_forbidden] is true_when_stale
  + [dependency_closed_status_forbidden] is true_when_ambiguous_identity
  + [dependency_closed_status_forbidden] is true_when_hidden_scope_expansion
  + [dependency_closed_status_forbidden] is true_when_unresolved_human_override
  + [required_field] is scope_relation
  + [required_field] is compatibility_relation
  + [required_field] is stale_trigger_ref_set
  + [required_field] is unresolved_review_ref_set
  + [required_field] is downstream_gate_state

& [ExpectedWorkBoundaryCaseSet: IR6CoordinationMailbox] is the per-fixture work-boundary ledger
  + [fixture_id] is valid_claim_projection
    + [expected_boundary_status] is dependency_closed
  + [fixture_id] is compatible_parallel_claims
    + [expected_boundary_status] is compatible_parallel
  + [fixture_id] is conflicting_write_claims
    + [expected_boundary_status] is blocked
  + [fixture_id] is stale_claim_refresh_required
    + [expected_boundary_status] is stale
  + [fixture_id] is hidden_scope_expansion_fault
    + [expected_boundary_status] is faulted
  + [fixture_id] is completion_gate_refusal_for_unresolved_claim
    + [expected_boundary_status] is blocked

  = must: refuse ready projection when conflict, staleness, ambiguity, hidden expansion, or unresolved review evidence exists
  = must: keep downstream gates closed until required coordination review is resolved
